	(text "THE TEXT RAM, THE CODE REGISTER, THE CHARACTER GENERATOR, THE TEXT SHIFTER, THE CURSOR FLAG" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15.24 12.7 0) (effects (font (size 2.5 2.5) (bold yes)) (justify left top)) (uuid "d8d645c2-7955-5ed8-8200-3e783a2e58e1"))
	(text "The text RAM's display port reads SA9-0 then D3 (the half: 0 the left character, 1 the right). IC17 takes a\ncode as dots 4 and 12 begin (D2), and IC20/A with it the cursor flag: SCUR AND (the half = CURH). The character\ngenerator IC18 is addressed by RA0-3, the code and the flag (A12: the cursor's forms); IC19 loads its byte 8\ndots after the code was taken (TLOAD, IC21/A: dots 3 and 11 with SDE2) and shifts it out bit 7 first as TDOT." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15.24 17.78 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid "f51b84bc-437f-5dd0-ada8-49ceba461c65"))
	(embedded_fonts no)
)
